&lt;p&gt;I am a Co-Manager for &lt;a href="https://www.gdg-sg.org"&gt;Google Developer Group - Singapore&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href="https://www.facebook.com/gdgsgorg"&gt;FB&lt;/a&gt;). And today was our annual &lt;a href="https://www.gdg-sg.org/2017/10/gdg-devfest-2017.html"&gt;GDG-SG DevFest 2017&lt;/a&gt; event. Apart from being an organizer, I was also a speaker. I gave a short talk on &lt;a href="https://github.com/GoogleChrome/puppeteer"&gt;Puppeteer&lt;/a&gt;. This post is (almost) a transcript of my speech today. Slides can be found &lt;a href="https://drive.google.com/open?id=0B6Mr-G5qbPLPT0JCTWl0N0w5M2s"&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>